sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as CLI / Session
    participant Catalog as Local SQLite Catalog
    participant Worker as Background Refresh Worker
    participant Sources as Cervantes Virtual / Wayback

    User->>CLI: Start interactive reader or one-shot random command
    alt Interactive startup
        opt Online and refresh due or Wayback bootstrap pending
            CLI->>Catalog: Try to acquire 5-minute refresh lease
            Catalog-->>CLI: Lease acquired or already held
            CLI-)Worker: Start detached worker only if lease was acquired
        end
        CLI->>Catalog: Read random entry
        Catalog-->>CLI: Local entry
        CLI-->>User: Display entry without waiting for network
    else One-shot random output
        CLI->>Catalog: Read random entry
        Catalog-->>CLI: Local entry
        CLI-->>User: Print entry without waiting for network
        opt Successful output, online, and Cervantes Virtual refresh due
            CLI->>Catalog: Try to acquire 5-minute refresh lease
            Catalog-->>CLI: Lease acquired or already held
            CLI-)Worker: Start detached worker only if lease was acquired
        end
    end

    alt Worker started: online, eligible work due, lease acquired, spawn succeeded
        Note over CLI,Worker: Reader remains responsive while refresh runs
        Worker->>Sources: Fetch selected source pages
        Sources-->>Worker: Return page data
        Worker->>Catalog: Save imported entries and progress
        Worker-->>CLI: Publish progress and completion state in catalog
    else Offline, no eligible work due, lease held, or spawn failed
        Note over CLI,Catalog: Serve the entry from the local catalog, no worker started
    end

    Note over Worker,Catalog: Five-minute lease usually prevents overlap, a worker delayed past expiry may overlap a new worker
    Note over Worker,Sources: Interactive startup may bootstrap A-Z, resumed bootstrap processes remaining letters through Z<br/>Only updates after bootstrap completion process one letter
    Note over CLI,Sources: One-shot output may refresh Cervantes Virtual when due, but never starts full Wayback bootstrap
    Note over User,CLI: Reader keys: u requests a forced online update if a lease is available, s opens or closes catalog statistics
